{"id":19762,"event":{"category":"regular","date":"2025-03-04T16:00:00.000Z","dateStarted":"2025-03-04T16:07:35.805Z","dateCompleted":"2025-03-04T19:42:01.560Z","decklists":false,"description":"Little bit of an update, due to just how much everyone loved the Chaos format IRL on Sunday we'll be switching things up and today's online tournament will be changed to a 3 round, best of 3 chaos tournament!\n\nEntry fee: Free.\n\nPrizes:\n1st place: 3 Event packs.\n2nd place: 2 Event packs.\n3rd place: 1 Event pack.\n\nNote: There will be no prizing for non-Middle East players since we don't currently have the capacity to ship outside of the Middle East. Hopefully in the future we will start shipping prizes to international players once we setup the logistics required to ship internationally. \n\nWhat is a chaos tournament? Good question! A chaos tournament is just a normal tournament with a bit of a twist. Every round we'll post all the pairings as usual but alongside that we'll also post two random game changing positive modifiers and two negative modifers to add a little bit of a twist on the game rules that change every round. \n\nSome examples of a positive modifers are: \nAll Champion Materialization costs 0.\nAll Ally's Cost 2 less.\nAll Spells cost 1 less.\n\nAnd some examples of negative modifiers are:\nAll non champion Materialization cost's 1 more.\nAll on enter triggers have suspend. (They don't resolve until the beginning of the player's next wake up step)\nChampions lose 1 Max HP at the beginning of each of their owners turns. (This cannot be healed)\n\nHope that looks fun and see ya'll soon!","host":{"id":607,"name":"GA Middle East Online Events","address":"","addressCountryCode":""},"id":19762,"judges":[957],"name":"Middle East Day 5 CHAOS Revelfest tourney!","players":[630,693,1959,7986,8155,9017,10807,12104,12106,12222,14363,14829],"ranked":true,"season":{"dateEnd":"2025-03-08T05:00:06.000Z","dateStart":"2024-10-18T05:00:00.000Z","id":3,"name":"Mortal Ambit